# -------- Weapons --------
Katana.FunctionText:
	'''
	Katana Spell [c/CDDEEF:<Iron Protection>]
	- +2 defense
	Katana Arts [c/FFFFFF:<Flash Attack>]
	- Dash and attack the enemy.
	'''
Muramasa.FunctionText:
	'''
	Katana Spell [c/0000FA:<Revengeance>]
	- When damaged, the ghost will counterattack.
	Katana Arts [c/0000CD:<Bloodthirsty Ghost>]
	- Summon a ghost for {N} seconds.
	- When the player attacks, the ghost will perform an additional attack.
	'''

